From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Port <port@local>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:05:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: vendor-prefixes: add the "bat" prefix

O device tree do board topaz descreve as informacoes de bateria
(bat,nr, bat,vid, bat,pid, bat,mfrs, bat,design_cap) com o prefixo "bat"
usado pelo fuel gauge vendor. Sem uma entrada em vendor-prefixes.yaml o
dt-validate rejeita cada uma dessas propriedades.

---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
index af9a8d43b..c773b2ee2 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/vendor-prefixes.yaml
@@ -204,6 +204,9 @@ patternProperties:
     description: BAIKAL ELECTRONICS, JSC
   "^bananapi,.*":
     description: BIPAI KEJI LIMITED
+  "^bat,.*":
+    description: Battery information used by the vendor fuel gauge
+
   "^beacon,.*":
     description: Compass Electronics Group, LLC
   "^beagle,.*":
-- 
2.39.5
